@startuml
title Measuring the maximum batch size under the per-transaction cap
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}
start
:Compile the contract with the production settings;
if (Target rules supported by a local node?) then (yes)
  :Deploy on anvil / Hardhat with the target hardfork;
  :Send the batch with gas limit 16,777,216;
  :Read gasUsed and status from the receipt;
else (no)
  :eth_simulateV1 on the target network
  (state overrides, validation: true);
endif
:Binary search on N (success -> upper half, out of gas -> lower half);
:Check one value against an independent measurement;
:Cost = gasUsed x gas price (Etherscan gas oracle);
stop
@enduml
